      "message": "personal preference: it hasn\u0027t been enshrined in skia style, but is a direction that Mike Reed had been going, and I\u0027ve also liked, but for non-boolean getters I like just naming them like `shape()` or `type()`. \n\nThe setters remain `setShape()` and the bool checks remain whatever makes sense for context, e.g. isShape() or hasFoo().",
